---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact & Support – Get in Touch"
  description={`Contact the ${siteConfig.name} team for technical support, bug reports, timezone data feedback, and feature suggestions.`}
  path="/contact/"
>
  <article class="content-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Support & Feedback</p>
    <h1>Contact {siteConfig.name}</h1>

    <p>
      We actively maintain {siteConfig.name} and appreciate feedback from users around the world.
      Whether you encountered an unexpected edge case in a time zone conversion, have an idea for a
      new Living Clock scene, or noticed a display bug on your device, we are here to listen.
    </p>

    <h2>Primary Contact Channel</h2>
    <p>
      For all inquiries, bug reports, and suggestions, please email us directly at:
    </p>
    <p class="contact-email-box">
      <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@clockgarden.com">contact@clockgarden.com</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      <em>Expected response time:</em> We typically review and respond to inquiries within 1 to 2 business days.
    </p>

    <h2>How to Report a Bug or Calculation Anomaly</h2>
    <p>
      To help us investigate and patch technical issues quickly, please consider including:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Operating System & Device:</strong> (e.g., macOS Sonoma, Windows 11, iOS 18, Android 15)</li>
      <li><strong>Browser & Version:</strong> (e.g., Chrome 128, Safari 18, Firefox 130)</li>
      <li><strong>Affected Tool:</strong> (Clock, Stopwatch, Timer, Alarm, World Clock, or Time Zone Converter)</li>
      <li><strong>Specific Inputs:</strong> For timezone or DST reports, include the source and destination cities/dates involved.</li>
      <li><strong>Observed vs. Expected Result:</strong> What happened, and what did you anticipate seeing?</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Feature Suggestions & Living Clock Art</h2>
    <p>
      Have an idea for an ambient theme or an aesthetic living clock environment? We love creative suggestions
      that align with our quiet, distraction-free design philosophy. Feel free to share your thoughts.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
